Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 07:28:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] test(conformance): add the Decryption Authority Lifecycle
 conformance kit adapter

Phase 4, P2.3. The vendor-neutral kit (DecryptionAuthorityLifecycle.t.sol,
copied byte for byte from the project's conformance/ directory) and this
line's adapter: grants (allow, allowTransient, allowForDecryption,
delegateForUserDecryption, multicall), the use and on-behalf views, the
executor's operand path, the upgrade guard and the previous ACL release
without Core. Run from host-contracts/ with FOUNDRY_ISOLATE=false (and once
with it on): 17 passed, 1 skipped (no on-chain permit).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
